  questTitle: Oil for Freedom
  description: "The government is promoting an oil drilling project as a step toward
    energy independence, but it\u2019s actually an environmental disaster. Your job
    is to expose the truth and sway public opinion."
  <QuestReward>k__BackingField: 0
  <questObjectives>k__BackingField:
