    targetValue: 8
    progressValue: 0
    objectiveType: 1
    description: Destroy 8 "Oil Propaganda Bots" spreading false claims about energy
      independence.
  - isDone: 0
    targetValue: 5
    progressValue: 0
    objectiveType: 3
    description: Classify 5 posts as misinformation, disinformation, or factual based
      on the oil drilling project.
  - isDone: 0
    targetValue: 5
    progressValue: 0
    objectiveType: 2
    description: Convince 4 NPCs who are loyal to the government that the oil drilling
      is harming the environment by providing scientific data.
